# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, correct.
#
# Without this, `COPY . .` in the builder stage drops the HOST's node_modules
# on top of the ones npm ci installed for the container. On a Windows or macOS
# host those contain binaries built for the wrong platform, and the build
# fails in ways that read as source errors rather than as what they are.

node_modules
.next
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.prod.example
npm-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.vscode
coverage
